### API de Armazenamento MinIO - Testes HTTP

# Base URL (ajuste conforme necessário)
@base_url = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 2. Upload de arquivo
# Use um arquivo real no seu sistema
POST {{base_url}}/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="teste.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Conteúdo de teste para upload no MinIO
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 3. Listar arquivos
GET {{base_url}}/files

### 4. Download de arquivo (stream direto)
GET {{base_url}}/files/teste.txt

### 5. Download com URL presignada
GET {{base_url}}/files/teste.txt?mode=url&expires=3600

### 6. Deletar arquivo
DELETE {{base_url}}/files/teste.txt
